  "description": "Polaris processors v1: per-processor consumed/emitted/failed/retry/DLQ rates and observed lag. Panels reference `polaris_processor_*` metrics defined in packages/shared-processor/src/metrics.ts. The $processor_name variable picks one of the five processors (analytics-projector, identity-resolver, sessionizer, geoip-enricher, attribution-engine).",
  "editable": false,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
