  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# Polaris Processors\n\nMetrics from `packages/shared-processor/src/metrics.ts`, exposed at each processor's `/metrics` endpoint. The v1 scrape config (`infra/prometheus/prometheus.yml`) lists `analytics-projector` explicitly; future processors join the same scrape pattern.\n\n**Per-processor row.** The template variable `$processor_name` selects one of `analytics-projector`, `identity-resolver`, `sessionizer`, `geoip-enricher`, `attribution-engine`. Pick `All` to see the fleet aggregate.\n\n**Latency.** `polaris_processor_lag_seconds` and `polaris_processor_handler_duration_seconds` are histograms (CSH8YAL6); the p50/p99 panels at the bottom of the dashboard use them. The legacy `_ms_last` gauges are kept alongside during the transition for the `max` / `lastNotNull` panels — feel free to favour the histogram panels.\n\n**DLQ backlog.** DLQ growth is shown as a **rate**, not as the dead-letter table's total backlog. For a true backlog gauge, query the `polaris_dlq_records` table directly via the DLQ triage runbook (P10-006).",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum by (processor_name) (rate(polaris_processor_events_consumed_total{processor_name=~\"$processor_name\", environment=\"$environment\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{processor_name}} — consumed",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Events consumed (5m, ops)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
